  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes Quantum Gated Recurrent Neural Networks (QLSTM and QGRU) implemented with hardware‑efficient PQCs and demonstrates them on three tasks: an adding‑problem sequence benchmark (T=750), synthetic gene‑regulatory network prediction, and stock‑price prediction for 12 equities (2018–2023). The models achieve competitive or better prediction accuracy than several classical and hybrid baselines while using only 63 (QLSTM) or 42 (QGRU) trainable parameters, but all experiments are performed on classical simulators without complexity or runtime advantage analysis.",
